  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Using a meat mallet or rolling pin, smash Quke until they split open on the sides, then roughly chop.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0fc0df8f6928425d5c084/step-ab129700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine miso paste, sesame dressing, the honey and vinegar. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0fc0df8f6928425d5c084/step-f8975610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small heatproof bowl, combine garlic, low sodium soy sauce, a good pinch of sugar and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• In a large frying pan, heat olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people) over high heat, until just smoking, 30 seconds - 1 minute, then carefully pour the oil over the garlic mixture. Set aside.\n• TIP: The hot oil will bubble up and 'cook' the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0fc0df8f6928425d5c084/step-49a35e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, add vegetable gyoza, flat-side down, in a single layer.\n• Cook until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (watch out, it may spatter!) and cover with foil or a lid.\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyoza are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0fc0df8f6928425d5c084/step-cd709330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To the bowl with miso dressing, add deluxe salad mix, mixed salad leaves and smashed Quke. Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0fc0df8f6928425d5c084/step-39ff3a40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sesame-miso smashed Quke salad and veggie potstickers between bowls.\n• Garnish with crispy shallots. Serve with garlic chilli oil. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e0fc0df8f6928425d5c084/step-0c97ef50.jpg"
    }
  ]
